The plate looks like a dinner plate of about 26 cm, spanning roughly 400 px, so about 15 px per cm. The bacon pieces are around 330 px long at most, which is about 20 cm for the longest. That length probably covers one long strip plus a couple of shorter pieces, so I'd guess about 3 slices of cooked bacon.

Cooked bacon runs about 8 g and 43 kcal per slice, though thicker slices weigh more, maybe 10 g and about 54 kcal. These look dark and crisp, and a bit thick. Three slices at roughly 9 g each gives about 27 g and about 150 kcal.

